      "id": "O-01",
      "mode": "linear_program",
      "title": "二段階Simplex・線形計画",
      "header": "combinatorial_optimization/linear_program.hpp",
      "doc": "optimization_extensions/linear_program.md",
      "example": "optimization_extensions/linear_program.cpp",
      "api": "linear_program<T>(A,b,c,options)、free_linear_program<T>。最大化・Ax≤b。",
      "condition": "通常はx≥0、free版は符号自由。BigRationalは厳密、浮動型は絶対epsilon判定。最適・実行不能・非有界・反復上限・非有限計算を区別する。",
      "complexity": "m制約・n変数・P pivotでO((P+1)(m+1)(n+m+1))体演算、O((m+1)(n+m+1))領域。Bland規則でも最悪指数時間。",
      "principle": "人工変数の総和を最小化し、実行可能基底を得て元の目的を改善する。",
      "sample": {
        "A": [
          [
            1,
            1
          ],
          [
            1,
            0
          ],
          [
            0,
            1
          ]
        ],
        "b": [
          4,
          2,
          3
        ],
        "c": [
          3,
          2
        ],
        "max_pivots": 80
      },
      "output": "optimal 10/1\n2/1 2/1\n"
    },
    {
